{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#card-zh","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Echelon 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型路由插件：把多个真实模型编成用户命名的挡位，并以挡位作为模型选择器中的虚拟模型。它按配置顺序尝试链中成员，在失败或超时后重试或切换后备模型；会依据上下文窗口与图像能力筛选候选，并可映射不同模型的思考强度。设置页可编辑挡位、成员和显示规则，也提供探测与调用日志。适合希望在 DSH 中简化模型选择、为模型配置自动兜底的用户；需要兼容版本的 DSH 与 Node。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-25","src/adapter.js:803-963","src/tokens.js:117-140","client.js:1-17"]}
{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#card-en","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Echelon routes models in DSH through named tiers: ordered chains with retries and failover. It can route by context window and image support, and provides reasoning mapping, a settings page and request log. For users wanting a simpler model menu with automatic fallback.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-25","src/adapter.js:803-963","src/tokens.js:117-140","client.js:1-17"]}
