{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#feature-1","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Echelon 的「挡位链式派发」功能：将多个 provider/model 按优先顺序组成一个虚拟模型；选择挡位后逐个派发，遇到可重试失败时继续尝试后续成员。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapter.js:803-963"]}
{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#feature-2","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Echelon 的「上下文窗口筛选」功能：估算消息与工具输入的 token 数，并结合输出预留计算可用窗口；派发时跳过无法容纳请求的成员。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tokens.js:75-103","src/tokens.js:117-140"]}
{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#feature-3","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Echelon 的「图像能力路由」功能：检测请求历史中的图像块，并用成员视觉能力筛选或排序候选，使带图请求可以路由到支持图像输入的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tokens.js:143-155","src/adapter.js:803-879"]}
{"unit_id":"Abnerluo123__dsh-echelon#feature-4","repo":"Abnerluo123/dsh-echelon","commit":"f483319d51694d1c8d220b079da9fce696ac24ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Echelon 的「设置与调用日志」功能：在设置页维护挡位、成员和模型显示规则；插件保存设置文件，并提供最近派发尝试、结果与耗时的日志视图。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1-17","src/store.js:98-151","src/log.js:43-65"]}
